  "notes": "{履修|りしゅう} refers to registering for and taking academic courses, common in university contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する: {履修|りしゅう}する (to take/register for a course)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {履修|りしゅう}{登録|とうろく}: course registration\n- {履修|りしゅう}{科目|かもく}: courses being taken\n- {必修|ひっしゅう}{科目|かもく}を{履修|りしゅう}する: to take required courses\n- {選択|せんたく}{科目|かもく}を{履修|りしゅう}する: to take elective courses\n\nRELATED ACADEMIC VOCABULARY:\n- {単位|たんい}: credit\n- {卒業|そつぎょう}: graduation\n- {必修|ひっしゅう}: required (course)",
